    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1677">

                <pb facs="1065" n="949" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg949"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 817.51/688a.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Minister Jefferson.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-10-03">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 3, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department approves general principles of contract now being made with bankers
                    but has not had an opportunity to consider details. Hope Congress will adopt
                    system of taxation sufficient to provide for the needs of the Government.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
